flowchart TD
  subgraph C["Trust boundary 1: untrusted client"]
    ACTOR["Course admin / delegate / teacher"] --> INPUT["Course ID / grantee / capabilities / name / version"]
  end
  subgraph S["Trusted server: Development-only synthetic session"]
    API["Resolve session subject and validate input"] --> DEC["Administration service and shared ADM-08 checks"]
    DEC -->|Allow| MUT["View / rename / delegate / revoke"]
    DEC -->|No session, deny or unavailable| DENY["Normalize rejection without private details"]
    API -->|Transport validation failure: 400| OUT
    MUT -->|Authorized metadata or version conflict| OUT["Public response; never student answers"]
    MUT -->|Authority changed or unavailable| DENY
    DENY -->|400 / 401 / generic 404| OUT
    MUT -->|Actor, action, IDs, versions, outcome| AUD[("Metadata-only audit")]
    DENY -->|Internal reason and correlation| AUD
  end
  subgraph P["Trust boundary 2: trusted provider and store ports"]
    ACC[("Accounts")]
    GRANTS[("Course administrative grants")]
    COURSES[("Course metadata and version")]
  end
  INPUT -->|HTTP request| API
  DEC -->|Account ID| ACC
  ACC -->|Current account or failure| DEC
  DEC -->|Actor and course IDs| GRANTS
  GRANTS -->|Current scoped authority or failure| DEC
  DEC -->|Course ID| COURSES
  COURSES -->|Course snapshot or failure| DEC
  MUT -->|Capture and atomically compare authority| GRANTS
  GRANTS -->|Current grant, grant change or rejection| MUT
  MUT -->|Bound read or versioned metadata write| COURSES
  COURSES -->|Metadata, next version or failure| MUT
  OUT -->|HTTP status and permitted body| ACTOR
